      "description": "Horizontally browsable community selection.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><button class=\"ds-chip ds-selected\" aria-pressed=\"true\">सभी</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">कान्यकुब्ज</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">सरयूपारीण</button></div>",
